    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759870/extras/003bc22b86208d097ef3aac8ccb33e42.webp?t=1750341629\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Immerse yourself in the charming world of lazy yet irresistibly cute pandas, where every picture tells its own story! Spot hilarious scenes, hunt for hidden differences, and uncover all the secrets of these fluffy bamboo enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoon style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for all ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual gameplay </p></li></ul>",
